{"seq":4,"slug":"new-energy-vehicles","title":"新能源汽车技术","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/new-energy-vehicles","introMarkdown":"# 新能源汽车技术 简介\n\n新能源汽车产业正经历从政策驱动到市场驱动的历史性转变。2026年全球新能源汽车渗透率突破35%，中国市场渗透率超过50%，固态电池量产、800V高压平台普及、智能驾驶辅助L2+标配化成为行业新常态。本专业培养掌握动力电池、电驱动、整车电控和智能网联核心技术的高技能人才，对接新能源汽车维修技师、电池维护工程师、充电设施运维、品质检测等岗位需求。\n\n本课程体系围绕新能源汽车\"三电\"核心技术和智能化发展趋势，设置四个递进式学习模块：\n\n**第一章 动力电池技术**从锂电池化学原理和正负极材料体系入手，深入电池包结构设计与BMS电池管理系统，覆盖热管理、SOC估算、均衡策略等关键技术，最终落地到电池检测、故障诊断与梯次利用的实操技能。\n\n**第二章 电驱动系统**系统讲解永磁同步电机、异步感应电机等主流驱动方案，深入电机控制器的IGBT/SiC功率拓扑与FOC矢量控制算法，延伸到减速器、多挡DHT和电驱总成的集成设计与NVH优化。\n\n**第三章 整车电子与控制**聚焦车载网络通信协议（CAN/CAN-FD/车载以太网）和整车电子架构，深入交直流充电技术与V2G双向充放电，并覆盖热泵空调与整车热管理系统的设计调试。\n\n**第四章 智能网联汽车**对接行业最新发展方向，从ADAS传感器融合到L2+自动驾驶功能实现，涵盖高精地图、V2X车路协同、OTA远程升级，以及新能源汽车特有的高压安全操作和整车故障诊断维保流程。\n\n建议学习路径：先掌握动力电池与电驱动的硬件基础（第一、二章），再学习整车电子控制与充电技术（第三章），最后进入智能网联与综合诊断（第四章）。学习过程中注重理论与实训结合，通过实验台架操作、故障模拟诊断和项目式任务巩固技能。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"power-battery-technology","title":"动力电池技术","docCount":3,"url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/new-energy-vehicles/power-battery-technology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"battery-principles-materials","title":"电池原理与材料","url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/new-energy-vehicles/power-battery-technology/battery-principles-materials"},{"seq":2,"slug":"battery-pack-bms","title":"电池包与BMS","url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/new-energy-vehicles/power-battery-technology/battery-pack-bms"},{"seq":3,"slug":"battery-testing-maintenance","title":"电池检测与维护","url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/new-energy-vehicles/power-battery-technology/battery-testing-maintenance"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"electric-drive-systems","title":"电驱动系统","docCount":3,"url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/new-energy-vehicles/electric-drive-systems","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"motor-types-principles","title":"电机类型与原理","url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/new-energy-vehicles/electric-drive-systems/motor-types-principles"},{"seq":2,"slug":"motor-controller-inverter","title":"电机控制器与逆变器","url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/new-energy-vehicles/electric-drive-systems/motor-controller-inverter"},{"seq":3,"slug":"transmission-integration","title":"传动系统与集成","url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/new-energy-vehicles/electric-drive-systems/transmission-integration"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"vehicle-electronics-control","title":"整车电子与控制","docCount":3,"url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/new-energy-vehicles/vehicle-electronics-control","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"vehicle-can-network","title":"车载网络与通信","url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/new-energy-vehicles/vehicle-electronics-control/vehicle-can-network"},{"seq":2,"slug":"charging-technology","title":"充电技术","url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/new-energy-vehicles/vehicle-electronics-control/charging-technology"},{"seq":3,"slug":"thermal-management-hvac","title":"热管理与空调系统","url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/new-energy-vehicles/vehicle-electronics-control/thermal-management-hvac"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"intelligent-connected-vehicles","title":"智能网联汽车","docCount":3,"url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/new-energy-vehicles/intelligent-connected-vehicles","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"adas-sensors","title":"ADAS与传感器","url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/new-energy-vehicles/intelligent-connected-vehicles/adas-sensors"},{"seq":2,"slug":"autonomous-driving-basics","title":"自动驾驶基础","url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/new-energy-vehicles/intelligent-connected-vehicles/autonomous-driving-basics"},{"seq":3,"slug":"vehicle-diagnostics-maintenance","title":"整车故障诊断与维护","url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/new-energy-vehicles/intelligent-connected-vehicles/vehicle-diagnostics-maintenance"}]}]}